<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, that old rugged cross, so despised by the world,</l><l>Has a wondrous attraction for me;</l><l>For the dear Lamb of God left His glory above,</l><l>To bear it to dark Calvary.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In the old rugged cross, stained with blood so divine,</l><l>A wondrous beauty I see;</l><l>For ’twas on that old cross Jesus suffered and died,</l><l>To pardon and sanctify me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
